{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Days.</b> The meaning is year upon year." "<b>רגזה.</b> With missing nun, and the Nagid [Samuel ben Hananiah] says it is in the imperative mood, and if it is in the masculine, and R. Moses the Kohen said it is a noun of action." "<b>Gathered [without יבוא].</b> The meaning is pleonastic: gathered the grain."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {1 "The syntax is compressed and elliptical; 'and if it is in the masculine' appears to be an incomplete objection or counter-argument, rendered hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:24.094091453Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}